WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.090
Here's how to install the ChatGPT app on Windows,

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.130
and connect it to a server over SSH.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.380
Open the Microsoft Store and search for ChatGPT.

4
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.450
Pick the app published by OpenAI,

5
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.050
then click Get.

6
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.760
When it's installed, click Open and log in.

7
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:31.410
Then open Settings, Connections, and the SSH tab.

8
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:32.850
Switch on your server.

9
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:40.160
If it fails, ask Codex in a chat to fix passwordless login.

10
00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.880
Run the command it gives you on the server,

11
00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.320
then type done.

12
00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:49.830
If Codex isn't installed on the server,

13
00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.830
ask it to install it there too.

14
00:00:54.880 --> 00:01:00.220
Back in Settings, click Reconnect, and wait until it says Connected.

15
00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:04.050
Pick a project folder on the server,

16
00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.730
and you're ready to go.
